    "description": "Shooting Pool is a relaxing billiard game with HD graphics and realistic physics. You can feel all the 3D effect base on \u201cAugmented Reality\u201d.\r\n\r\n- There are dozens of special-type billiard tables with different shapes.\r\n-There are more than 2000 levels that are never repeated.\r\n-There are hundreds of unique cue skins here, all of which can be obtained for free.\r\n\r\nThe gradual difficulty will make you really relax in this game.\r\n\r\nCome and experience a refreshing game of billiards! You will be addicted to \"Shooting Pool\"!",
